<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;AGRINIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Agrinio is a town in Greece known for its football culture and hosting of Panetolikos F.C.'s match against their rivals."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PANETOLIKOS F.C.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Panetolikos F.C. is a beloved football team based in Agrinio, preparing for a big match against their rivals."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KEVIN SMITH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kevin Smith is an American basketball player who has recently joined Panetolikos F.C. and is admired by the local fans."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATHENS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Athens is mentioned as the home of the rival team, symbolizing the competition between Panetolikos F.C. and their opponents."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COACH DIMITRI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coach Dimitri is a gruff but lovable man with a thick Greek accent, leading Panetolikos F.C. and motivating the team before the match."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NBA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"NBA is the professional basketball league where Kevin Smith previously played, contrasting with his current role in football."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PANETOLIKOS FAITHFUL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Panetolikos faithful are the passionate supporters of the team, filling the stadium and waving flags during the match."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RICHMOND SPIDERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Richmond Spiders is the men's basketball team of the University of Richmond, where Kevin Smith plays."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHRIS MOONEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chris Mooney is the head coach of the Richmond Spiders men's basketball team, praising Kevin Smith's contributions to the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JACOB GILYARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jacob Gilyard is a point guard for the Richmond Spiders, highlighting Kevin Smith's leadership qualities and positive impact on the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF RICHMOND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Richmond is the institution where the Richmond Spiders men's basketball team competes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOUVLAKI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FOOD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Souvlaki is a traditional Greek dish enjoyed by the locals in Agrinio, adding to the festive atmosphere of the match day."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TAVERNA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tavernas in Agrinio are places where the locals gather to enjoy food and drinks, reflecting the community's excitement for the match."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DREADLOCKS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"APPEARANCE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dreadlocks are a distinctive hairstyle worn by Kevin Smith, setting him apart and making him memorable to the locals."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOOTBALL BOOTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ITEM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Football boots are the footwear Kevin Smith wears during the match, symbolizing his transition from basketball to football."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WHISTLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ITEM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The whistle marks the start of the match, signaling the beginning of intense competition."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JERSEYS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ITEM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jerseys are signed by Kevin Smith, representing his popularity and the team's appreciation for his contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STADIUM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The stadium is the venue where the match takes place, filled with fans and teams, creating a vibrant atmosphere."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GREEN AND WHITE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COLOR"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Green and white are the colors of Panetolikos F.C., symbolizing the team's identity and unity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEADER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Headers are a key aspect of football, showcasing Kevin Smith's athleticism and skill on the field."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BASKETBALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SPORT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Basketball is the sport Kevin Smith excels in, contrasting with his current role in football."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATHLETICISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TRAIT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kevin Smith's athleticism is highlighted throughout the text, demonstrating his physical prowess in both sports."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORK ETHIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TRAIT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kevin Smith's strong work ethic is praised by his coaches and teammates, emphasizing his dedication to the sport."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COURT VISION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TRAIT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Court vision is a key attribute of Kevin Smith, allowing him to make strategic decisions on the field."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GAME-CHANGER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kevin Smith is described as a game-changer, indicating his significant impact on the match and the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0450</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;PANETOLIKOS F.C.&quot;" target="&quot;KEVIN SMITH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Kevin Smith has joined Panetolikos F.C. and is admired by the local fans, bringing a new dynamic to the team."</data>
      <data key="d5">"new player, fan admiration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0450</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PANETOLIKOS F.C.&quot;" target="&quot;ATHENS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Panetolikos F.C. is competing against their rivals from Athens, adding tension to the match."</data>
      <data key="d5">"rivalry, competition"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0450</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PANETOLIKOS F.C.&quot;" target="&quot;PANETOLIKOS FAITHFUL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Panetolikos faithful support the team passionately, creating a lively atmosphere in the stadium during the match."</data>
      <data key="d5">"fan support, atmosphere"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0450</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KEVIN SMITH&quot;" target="&quot;COACH DIMITRI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Coach Dimitri motivates Kevin Smith before the match, emphasizing the team's goal of defeating their rivals from Athens."</data>
      <data key="d5">"motivation, team spirit"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0450</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KEVIN SMITH&quot;" target="&quot;NBA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Kevin Smith previously played in the NBA, contrasting with his current role in football, indicating a career transition."</data>
      <data key="d5">"career transition, past experience"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0450</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KEVIN SMITH&quot;" target="&quot;RICHMOND SPIDERS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Kevin Smith is a member of the Richmond Spiders men's basketball team, contributing significantly to the team's success."</data>
      <data key="d5">"team member, contributions"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0450</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KEVIN SMITH&quot;" target="&quot;CHRIS MOONEY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Chris Mooney, the head coach of the Richmond Spiders, praises Kevin Smith's contributions to the team, highlighting his reliability and impact."</data>
      <data key="d5">"praise, leadership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0450</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KEVIN SMITH&quot;" target="&quot;JACOB GILYARD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Jacob Gilyard, a point guard for the Richmond Spiders, credits Kevin Smith for his positive energy and leadership, emphasizing his value to the team."</data>
      <data key="d5">"positive energy, leadership"</data>
